{"schema":1,"locale":"zh-Hans","created_at":"2026-11-28T13:39:26.123Z","entries":{"docs-7.24\u0000## ip/tftp/settings **Type:** Settings Directory":"## ip/tftp/settings \n**类型：** 设置目录","docs-7.24\u0000## ip/upnp **Type:** Settings Directory":"## ip/upnp \n**类型：** 设置目录","docs-7.24\u0000## ip/vrf **Type:** Directory":"## ip/vrf \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## ipv6/address **Type:** Directory":"## ipv6/address \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## ipv6/dhcp-client **Type:** Directory":"## ipv6/dhcp-client \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## ipv6/dhcp-client/option **Type:** Directory":"## ipv6/dhcp-client/option \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## ipv6/dhcp-client/release **Type:** Command":"## ipv6/dhcp-client/release \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## ipv6/dhcp-client/renew **Type:** Command":"## ipv6/dhcp-client/renew \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## ipv6/dhcp-relay/reset-counters **Type:** Command":"## ipv6/dhcp-relay/reset-counters \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000- `recommended` option will use `address` as a postfix and **subnet-id**, if subnet-id is provided. - `strict` will use **address** as a strict postfix. - `without-acquire` will not allocate a prefix from a pool and will allow other services to use the exact same prefix. The `without-acquire` option should be mainly used to create SLAAC address on a router which at the same time will be a DHCPv6 server providing addresses to client from the same subnet. </ArgTableRow> <ArgTableRow arg=\"interface\" typ=\"iface_enum\" mandatory=\"1\">Specifies the interface on which the IPv6 address is configured. You can select it from the pool of interfaces available on the router.</ArgTableRow> <ArgTableRow arg=\"eui-64\" typ=\"bool\">Whether to calculate EUI-64 address and use it as last 64 bits of the IPv6 address.</ArgTableRow> <ArgTableRow arg=\"advertise\" typ=\"bool\">Whether to enable stateless address configuration. The prefix of that address is automatically advertised three times to hosts using ICMPv6 protocol. The option is set by default for addresses with prefix length 64. If address is removed or changed, then old prefix will be deprecated by automatically advertising the old prefix with lifetime set to `0s` three times to hosts using ICMPv6 protocol.</ArgTableRow> <ArgTableRow arg=\"no-dad\" typ=\"bool\">If enabled(yes) - disables Duplicate Address Detection(DAD) for IPv6 addresses on an interface. This can be useful in scenarios where you want to assign static IPv6 addresses to devices and avoid the delay caused by DAD.</ArgTableRow> <ArgTableRow arg=\"auto-link-local\" typ=\"bool\">If you want to manually add a link‑local address to an interface, this setting lets you override the automatically generated IPv6 link‑local address.</ArgTableRow> </ArgTable>":"- 如果提供了 subnet-id，`recommended` 选项将使用 `address` 作为后缀和 **subnet-id**。\n- `strict` 将使用 **address** 作为严格后缀。\n- `without-acquire` 不会从地址池分配前缀，并允许其他服务使用完全相同的前缀。`without-acquire` 选项主要用于在路由器上创建 SLAAC 地址，同时该路由器作为 DHCPv6 服务器，从同一子网向客户端提供地址。\n</ArgTableRow>\n<ArgTableRow arg=\"interface\" typ=\"iface_enum\" mandatory=\"1\">指定配置 IPv6 地址的接口。可以从路由器上可用接口池中选择。</ArgTableRow>\n<ArgTableRow arg=\"eui-64\" typ=\"bool\">是否计算 EUI-64 地址并将其用作 IPv6 地址的最后 64 位。</ArgTableRow>\n<ArgTableRow arg=\"advertise\" typ=\"bool\">是否启用无状态地址配置。该地址的前缀会通过 ICMPv6 协议自动向主机通告三次。对于前缀长度为 64 的地址，该选项默认设置。如果地址被移除或更改，则旧前缀将被弃用：通过 ICMPv6 协议自动向主机通告旧前缀三次，并将生命周期设置为 `0s`。</ArgTableRow>\n<ArgTableRow arg=\"no-dad\" typ=\"bool\">如果启用（yes），则为接口上的 IPv6 地址禁用重复地址检测（DAD）。这适用于需要为设备分配静态 IPv6 地址并避免 DAD 造成延迟的场景。</ArgTableRow>\n<ArgTableRow arg=\"auto-link-local\" typ=\"bool\">如果要手动向接口添加链路本地地址，此设置可覆盖自动生成的 IPv6 链路本地地址。</ArgTableRow>\n</ArgTable>"}}
